      },
      "message": "test(ui): read the guide's legacy 3+2 warning and scroll to the 770M row\n\nTwo camcraft-ui lib tests went red on main after the merge batch of\nad0307b7a.\n\n- guide_projects::indexed_guide_preserves_legacy_basis_and_path: #3080\n  (#2991) gives a 3+2 FirstTraverseLow warning in the user's frame with\n  `tilted: true`. The cache saved in examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj\n  predates that. The test now accepts the regenerated form of a legacy\n  warning only when it names the same move, the same stock or fixture\n  top and the same raise. Every other warning still must match exactly.\n- machines_pane::the_sheet_states_rigid_tapping_in_words: #3204 adds a\n  row to the machine library, which moves the 770M row past the clip\n  edge of the list. The test now scrolls the row into view before the\n  click.\n\nFixes #3233\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
