      "message": "test(ui): pin that a legacy first-traverse warning needs the same raise\n\nA negative pin for `same_warning`: a different raise, a fixture top, an\nupright warning or another move does not match the saved warning. The\n770M test also asserts that the row exists before the click.\n\nFixes #3233\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
